    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You’ve noticed that mercy has a shape. You help the world remember it.”</em></p><ul><li>When your party resolves a conflict via <strong>Parley</strong>, surrender, negotiation, or other peaceful means where you had meaningful narrative involvement, you can, once per Soma Break, trigger a soft power realignment.</li><li>After that resolution, you may convert <strong>1 Economy OP</strong> into <strong>1 Soft Power OP</strong> for your faction, or vice versa, representing the quiet reshaping of reputations, rumors, and supply lines.</li><li>This conversion must be applied to the strategic turn most closely associated with that scenario (GM adjudicates exact timing).</li></ul>",
